  "content": "\n\n<p>Pretty Pipez（請勿與 Pretty Pipes 混淆）是一款旨在改善 Pipez 外觀的資源包。此資源包包含自訂模型，其複雜度高於原版，因此可能會影響遊戲效能。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>也請查看 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pretty-pipez-mekanism-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pretty Pipez：Mekanism 版！</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tIkdAkP.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1903\" height=\"1008\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/myTh7bZ.gif\" width=\"1903\" height=\"1008\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
